Description: Uzunyx desktop for KDE Plasma (metapackage)
 Installs the whole Uzunyx desktop on Plasma 6.7 or later: the Akane and
 Sora global themes with their colours, window decoration, Plasma theme,
 window buttons, icons and wallpapers, the edition switcher, the screen-edge
 gaps, the lock keys widget, the keyboard shortcuts and Tsunyx Launcher.
 .
 Recommended, installed by default but removable on their own: the KWin
 effects (window outline, open/close and genie animations) and the Alt guard
 plugin, which are built for one exact KWin version, the boot splash and the GRUB theme and hidden
 menu, which change how the PC boots, and the battery widget.
